        "text": "Reference class/base rate: the recent same-variant BLS shelter MoM reference class is the seven printed monthly changes from Dec 2025 through Jun 2026. Its mean is 0.30 percent, but the last print was 0.1 and the exact CUSR0000SAH1 index calculation gives Jun about 0.118 and May about 0.318, so the short-term trend is below the mean."
